0910c4ed9756309","yuanzhang-q-94fa33084a4569fc2012","yuanzhang-q-659de843ea4119456981","yuanzhang-q-425624d9cc0296ed548e","yuanzhang-q-2732d5bbabe53afe36f1"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"yuanzhang-q-2732d5bbabe53afe36f1","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-8bee1ac99299322d2f8a","layer":"original","quote":"正始元年，戴鵀之鸟〖18〗，巢臶门阴〖19〗。臶告门人曰：“夫戴鵀阳鸟，而巢门阴，此凶祥也。”乃援琴歌咏，作诗二篇；旬日而卒，时年一百五岁","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":520,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":69},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-425624d9cc0296ed548e","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-3f40708a5e1edd31611b","layer":"original","quote":"任令于绰，连赍以问臶〖16〗。臶密谓绰曰：“夫神以知来，不追已往；祯祥先现，而后废兴从之。汉已久亡，魏已得之，何所追兴征祥乎〖17〗？此石，当今之变异，而将来之祯瑞","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":519,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":148,"end":230},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-4612783540362dddd036","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-9b0c0354a1911cdcf7ea","layer":"original","quote":"徙遁常山，门徒且数百人〖4〗。迁居任县","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":518,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":55,"end":74},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-659de843ea4119456981","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-9b0c0354a1911cdcf7ea","layer":"original","quote":"广平太守卢毓，到官三日，纲纪白：承前致版谒臶〖6〗。毓教曰：“张先生，所谓上不事天子，下不友诸侯者也。此岂版谒所可光饰哉！”但遣主簿奉书，致羊酒之礼","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":518,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":119,"end":193},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-69801b74fea51ca8b368","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-9b0c0354a1911cdcf7ea","layer":"original","quote":"并州牧高幹表除乐平令〖3〗，不就","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":518,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":38,"end":54},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-787ac0910c4ed9756309","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-9b0c0354a1911cdcf7ea","layer":"original","quote":"太祖为丞相，辟；不诣","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":518,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":75,"end":85},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-94fa33084a4569fc2012","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-9b0c0354a1911cdcf7ea","layer":"original","quote":"太和中，诏求隐学之士能消灾复异者〖5〗，郡累上臶；发遣，老病不行","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":518,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":86,"end":118},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-9cf856212a5688c9da92","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-9b0c0354a1911cdcf7ea","layer":"original","quote":"袁绍前后辟命，不应；移居上党","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":518,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":23,"end":37}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
